# SpacePulse Environment Variables Template
# All features in SpacePulse operate 100% frontend with public APIs (NOAA SWPC, CelesTrak, NASA/JPL Horizons)
#
# SECURITY DIRECTIVE:
# - SpacePulse is a 100% client-side React + Vite web application.
# - DO NOT place private secrets, tokens, or confidential keys in VITE_* environment variables.
# - All VITE_* variables are bundled into client-side JavaScript and visible to all users.
# - Never commit .env files, API keys, tokens, passwords, credentials, or private keys.
#
# Optional public configuration keys:
# VITE_NOAA_SWPC_URL=https://services.swpc.noaa.gov
# VITE_CELESTRAK_URL=https://celestrak.org
# VITE_NASA_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

